${buildUserProfileBlock()}
Recent journal entries (last 30):
${skinHistory || 'No entries yet.'}

User-reported sensitivities (avoid-list): ${sensList}

USER'S ACTUAL ROUTINE (last 30 days, from check-ins + photo logs — NOT shelf inventory):
${formatUsageForPrompt(usage30)}

